{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261021/photo/bkn-20261021015527139-1021_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261021022245\"/><p>汀九橋有人跳橋。</p><p>今日(21日)清晨1時16分，據報青馬管制區職員從閉路電視發現一輛私家車停在汀九橋往屯門方向橋面，職員前往了解時發現車內無人，懷疑有人跳橋自殺，遂報案求助。</p><p>救援人員及船隻在場展開搜索，其後在附近海面發現已陷入昏迷的事主，遂將其撈起，送往仁濟醫院救治。警員正調查其身份及輕生原因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T18:40:05.681535+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T17:55:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T18:38:25.058305+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:38:25.058305+00:00","content_hash":"2c958c47f2477fce90b078edd2493ca9183121678a779cf2fd8c1deff29277d0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}